{"id":51799,"date":"2026-06-23T08:18:11","date_gmt":"2026-06-23T07:18:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51799"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:35:59","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:35:59","slug":"trail-fatima","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-fatima\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail F\u00e1tima 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail F\u00e1tima 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>13\u00ba Trail de F\u00e1tima 2026<\/strong> \u00e9 um dos mais emblem\u00e1ticos e concorridos eventos de trail running do pa\u00eds, percorrendo as paisagens m\u00edsticas, serranias calc\u00e1rias e vales verdejantes do concelho de <strong>Our\u00e9m<\/strong> e da cidade de <strong>F\u00e1tima<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com sede no <strong>Centro de Trail de F\u00e1tima<\/strong> e certifica\u00e7\u00e3o oficial pela <strong>FPA<\/strong> e <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>, a prova integra o <strong>Circuito de Trail do Ribatejo (CTR)<\/strong> com os formatos de <strong>Trail Ultra (45 km com passagem pelo Castelo de Our\u00e9m)<\/strong>, <strong>Trail Longo (30 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Trail Curto (17 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Mini Trail (12 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Caminhada (12 km)<\/strong> e <strong>Trail Kids<\/strong>. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>F\u00e1tima Trail Team<\/strong> assegura abastecimentos de excel\u00eancia, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial e medalha de finalista.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">25 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 07:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; m